            "description": "<p align='center'>\r\n<img src=\"images\\yelphelp3.png\"/>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n# YelpHelp\r\nA simple scraping tool for Yelp.\r\n\r\n## Version 1.0.2\r\nCurrent as of 01/27/2023\r\n\r\n## Use\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom yelphelp import YelpHelp\r\n\r\nscraper=YelpHelp()\r\n\r\ndataframe=scraper.scrape_data(url='<startingurl>')\r\n\r\n```\r\n",
